  "details": "The VRChat camera system had a major upgrade several months ago. However, a further improvement would be very interesting for Content Creators.\nA camera travelling system.\nLet me explain: The system would consist in being able to define a \"path\" that a moving camera could follow at a speed given by the player. The options could be identical to the camera already present in the game and would allow for very interesting map shots.\nThanks in advance for your UPVotes",
